prompt_template:
Create one finished editorial campaign poster in {ASPECT_RATIO}. Output native 2K pixels: 1152 x 2048 for a 9:16 canvas, or 2048 x 1152 for a 16:9 canvas. This is a new creative extension of a monumental photographic typography style. PRIORITIZED STYLE: {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
SUBJECT: {SUBJECT}
CAMERA: {CAMERA}
PALETTE: {PALETTE}
EXACT HEADLINE: {MAIN_TEXT}
Render that phrase exactly once as the primary headline, without punctuation or any additional copy, in giant heavy condensed white or cream uppercase sans-serif type. All words must remain readable.
DESIGN INTENTION: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Use lifelike high-end editorial photography, material-appropriate directional light, sparse art direction and strong scale contrast. Keep fine texture inside the photographed material; graphic letters are clean, solid and unweathered. Preserve the specified reference-style texture, edge character and intentional softness at their described scale, intensity and locations. Avoid artifacts that are absent from the intended style; do not automatically denoise, sharpen, polish or distress the image.
EXCLUDE: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
Deliver one borderless poster, no mockup, no contact sheet, no UI, no watermark. Honor the requested 2K pixel dimensions.
